Create a dense collection of intentional voxel curl clusters.

The hairstyle should form a compact rounded-angular afro-inspired silhouette with visible stepped volume.

Avoid:

- One solid black cube.
- A rectangular helmet.
- A smooth sphere.
- Random disconnected voxel blocks.
- Extremely spiky anime hair.
- Long straight hair.
- A flat top with no depth.

